      "story_intro": "烽灯连营之后，夜巡迎来最静的一季：霜刃之灵不派军队，只沿着两条径磨刀——每磨一下，哨线的灯就白一层。联盟明白这是最后一段考验的心气：刀声越轻，守的人越要醒。艾吉把第一哨的名单写在了灯罩内侧。",
      "story_intro_en": "After the beacon chain came the watch's quietest season: the frost-blade spirit sent no army, only the sound of a whetstone traveling both lanes — and with every stroke the lamps whitened one shade. The league knew the temper of a final trial: the softer the blade is sharpened, the deeper the keeper must stay awake. Eggy wrote the first watch's roster on the inside of the lamp hood.",
      "story_outro": "磨声在换哨时停住。霜刃之灵收刀入鞘，鞘口垂下一条霜色穗子，指着镜池的方向：灯影成双处，照见第二哨。",
      "story_outro_en": "The whetting stopped at the change of watch. The spirit sheathed its blade and let a frost-colored tassel point from the scabbard toward the Mirror Pool: where lamps twin in the water, there stands the second watch."
