      "story_intro": "镜池的规矩是不许单独过池：每条径的影子都会被池底另一盏『灯』接住——那是夜巡先辈留在镜里的旧哨。考题为『辨影』：塔必须在两个自己之间，认出哪一边抱着蛋。艾吉上哨前对自己点了三次头。",
      "story_intro_en": "The Mirror Pool forbids crossing alone: on each lane a shadow is caught below by another lamp — old posts left in the glass by the watch's forebears. This exam is called Telling Shades: between two selves, the towers must name the one that cradles the egg. Before the watch, Eggy nodded to the water three times.",
      "story_outro": "双璧各自归位，池底的旧哨朝岸边抱了抱拳。水面合拢前最后荡开一行字：火炕见。",
      "story_outro_en": "The twin lamps returned to their frames and the pool-floor sentinels saluted from below. Before the water sealed, one last ripple spelled itself: see you at the underfloor fires."
    },
