      "story_intro": "夜河封冻前最后一渡，渡的不是人，是火：双径的灯要在冰合之前互渡彼岸，飞贼趁夜专袭交接的空档。这是夜巡三季以来最接近实战的一课——真正的敌人，从不挑灯好的时候来。",
      "story_intro_en": "Before the night river closed under ice, its last ferry carried not people but fire: the lamps of both lanes must cross to the far bank before the ice knits shut, and sky-thieves struck exactly at the handover gaps. The closest thing to a real night in all three seasons of the watch — the true enemy never waits for good lamplight.",
      "story_outro": "河在月落后封冻，最后那盏灯已安睡彼岸。冰层替夜巡记了帐；渡铃响过一声，向上游的山顶指去——那里有最后一哨。",
      "story_outro_en": "The river froze at moonset with the last lamp already home on the far side. Ice kept its tally; the ferry bell rang once and pointed upslope — to the summit's last watch."
    },
