      ],
      "story_intro": "夜巡的最后一季在雪峰收口：三径同灯，如三卷同阅。寒源倾出压轴三影——霜刃、镜影与炕火的旧账各踏一径，只为问夜巡最后一个问题：当所有的哨都站完了，谁来做天亮以后第一个醒着的人？艾吉把蛋举到山顶，像举起一盏不用守的灯。",
      "story_intro_en": "The watch's last season closes on Snowpeak: three roads to one lamp, like three scrolls read as one. The cold source spent its final three shades — the frost blade, the mirror's twin and the kang-fire's old ledger, each treading a road — to ask the watch its last question: when every post has been stood, who will be the first to wake after morning? Eggy lifted the egg to the summit like a lamp that no longer needs guarding.",
      "story_outro": "三影在峰前交戟，随残星归野。天亮了——此后每个清晨，村庄里最先睁开眼的那个人，都自动继承了夜巡的姓名。卷终。",
      "story_outro_en": "At the summit the three shades crossed halberds and went home with the falling stars. Dawn came — and from then on, whoever in the village opens their eyes first at morning inherits, by that very act, the name of the Night Watch. Finis."
